  "rows": [
    {
      "page": 1,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 2,
      "enSentences": 3,
      "ko": "노란 대문이 열리면, 유하는 앞만 보고 걸어요. 척, 척, 척.",
      "en": "The yellow gate came open. Yuha walked and did not look back. Step, step, step.",
      "who": [
        "yuha"
      ],
      "where": "home",
      "shot": "wide"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 3,
      "enSentences": 3,
      "ko": "초록빛 숲에는 아기 사슴 콩이가 살아요. 콩이는 숨기 대장이에요. \"쉿, 나 지금 없어.\"",
      "en": "A little deer called Kongi lived in the green woods. Kongi was so good at hiding. \"Shh, I am not here.\"",
      "who": [
        "character-5024d787-0765-4e9e-8c23-e53987b5c3f4"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "medium"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 3,
      "enSentences": 3,
      "ko": "그런데 작은 꽃 뒤로 하얀 꼬리가 뿅! 너는 봤지? 유하는 아직 못 봤어요.",
      "en": "But pop! A white tail came up by a little flower. Did you see it?",
      "who": [
        "character-5024d787-0765-4e9e-8c23-e53987b5c3f4"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "closeup"
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 2,
      "enSentences": 3,
      "ko": "\"엄마, 콩이 어디 숨었어? 내가 꼭 찾을 거야!\"",
      "en": "Yuha did not see it yet. \"Mom, where is Kongi? I will find Kongi!\"",
      "who": [
        "yuha",
        "mom"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "high_angle"
    },
    {
      "page": 5,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 4,
      "enSentences": 4,
      "ko": "둥근 나무 뒤를 쏙. \"여기 있지? 찾았…다? 아니네!\"",
      "en": "Yuha looked by a round tree. \"Here? Found you? No!\"",
      "who": [
        "yuha"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "from_behind"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 4,
      "enSentences": 3,
      "ko": "유하가 허리를 숙여요. \"콩이 어디 있지?\" 콩이도 허리를 숙여요. 바로 유하 뒤에서.",
      "en": "Yuha got down low. \"Where is Kongi?\" Kongi got down low too, right at his back.",
      "who": [
        "yuha",
        "character-5024d787-0765-4e9e-8c23-e53987b5c3f4"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "over_shoulder"
    },
    {
      "page": 7,
      "kind": "spread",
      "koSentences": 4,
      "enSentences": 4,
      "ko": "엄마가 입을 꾹 다물어요. \"음… 엄마는 아무것도 못 봤어.\" 어깨가 들썩들썩, 볼이 빵빵. 푸흡!",
      "en": "Mom shut her lips. \"Hmm, I did not see a thing.\" Her cheeks got big. Pfft!",
      "who": [
        "mom"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "medium"
    },
    {
      "page": 8,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 3,
      "enSentences": 2,
      "ko": "이번엔 작은 꽃 뒤. 쏙! …아니네!",
      "en": "Now Yuha looked by a little flower. No!",
      "who": [
        "yuha"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "closeup"
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 3,
      "enSentences": 3,
      "ko": "유하가 뛰어요. 콩이도 뛰어요. 쫄랑쫄랑, 쫄랑쫄랑.",
      "en": "Yuha ran. Kongi ran too. Hop, hop, hop.",
      "who": [
        "yuha",
        "character-5024d787-0765-4e9e-8c23-e53987b5c3f4"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "low_angle"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 3,
      "enSentences": 3,
      "ko": "유하가 멈춰요. 콩이도 멈춰요. 딱!",
      "en": "Yuha stopped. Kongi stopped too. Stop!",
      "who": [
        "yuha",
        "character-5024d787-0765-4e9e-8c23-e53987b5c3f4"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "closeup"
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 5,
      "enSentences": 3,
      "ko": "이번엔 커다란 바위 뒤. \"여기 있지? 찾았…다? 아니네!\" 유하가 털썩 앉아요.",
      "en": "Now Yuha looked by a big stone. \"Not here!\" said Yuha, and he sat down.",
      "who": [
        "yuha"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "from_behind"
    },
    {
      "page": 12,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 3,
      "enSentences": 2,
      "ko": "엄마는 말해 주고 싶어서 입이 근질근질해요. 그래도 꾹 참고 물어요. \"유하야, 아직 안 본 데가 어디일까?\"",
      "en": "Mom wanted to tell him so much. But she just asked, \"Yuha, where did you not look?\"",
      "who": [
        "mom"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "wide"
    },
    {
      "page": 13,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 3,
      "enSentences": 3,
      "ko": "유하가 생각해요. 앞도 보고 옆도 봤어요. 위도 봤는데…",
      "en": "Yuha had a think. He looked this way and that way. He looked up too, but…",
      "who": [
        "yuha"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "medium"
    },
    {
      "page": 14,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 3,
      "enSentences": 3,
      "ko": "휙! 코랑 코가 콩! \"찾았다!\"",
      "en": "Whoosh! Nose and nose went bop! \"Found you!\"",
      "who": [
        "yuha",
        "character-5024d787-0765-4e9e-8c23-e53987b5c3f4"
      ],
      "where": "forest",
      "shot": "closeup"
    },
    {
      "page": 15,
      "kind": "page",
      "koSentences": 5,
      "enSentences": 6,
      "ko": "콩이가 꼬리를 파르르 떨어요. \"쉿, 나 지금 없어.\" 이번엔 엄마도 하하하 웃어요. 다음 날, 노란 대문이 열려요. 유하는 한 걸음 걷고, 휙 뒤를 돌아봐요.",
      "en": "Kongi's tail went wag, wag. \"Shh, I am not here.\" This time Mom laughed too. Ha, ha, ha! The next day, the yellow gate came open. Yuha went one step and looked back fast!",
      "who": [
        "yuha",
        "character-5024d787-0765-4e9e-8c23-e53987b5c3f4",
        "mom"
      ],
      "where": "home",
      "shot": "wide"
    }
  ]
